    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Farrell Auctioneers, Valuers & Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market this beautiful 4-bedroom property, located in the heart of the countryside in Peterswell which is one of Co. Galway`s hidden rural gems. Set back off the road the property is accessed through a tarred driveway with beautifully maintained lawn gardens, shrubs, and trees. The property which was built in 2001 enjoys beautifully crafted stone walls to the front defining the boundary, generous parking space and a detached garage.\n\nThe bright, spacious entrance hallway welcomes you into this lovely family home. Accommodation extends to approx. 1,507 sq.ft and includes \n\nExternally the property is set on a 0.71 mature landscaped site with a host of mature shrubs and tree. \n\nPeterswell is a small village, close to Ardrahan and only 4 miles east of the busy market town Gort. All the amenities are available close by- i.e. primary and secondary schools, shops, pharmacies, restaurants, and bars are close by. Galway city is only a 30-minute drive and Shannon airport 25-minute drive.\n\nTo arrange to view the property please contact our office on 091 - 632688 or email colm@colmfarrell.com"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.5m (14'9\") x 1.75m (5'9\")\nThis area has a UPVC door with glass panels. Feature light with matching wall lights.\n\nSitting Room - 5m (16'5\") x 5.35m (17'7\")\nThis room has SE and SW facing windows. Wooden surround fireplace with granite hearth.\n\nKitchen/Dining room - 7.6m (24'11\") x 3.3m (10'10\")\nThe room has WELF flooring, bespoke fitted kitchen units, a stainless-steel sink with mixer tap, and a NW-facing window. The kitchen is also fitted with a range of integrated appliances.\n\nDining Area:\nThe dining area features WELF flooring and benefits from double doors providing access to the rear of the property.\n\nUtility - 3.3m (10'10\") x 2.95m (9'8\")\nThis room has ample storage, a spacious cloak closet with shelving, and is plumbed for a washer and dryer.\n\nInternal Hall - 7.6m (24'11\") x 1.07m (3'6\")\nThis area provides access to a spacious hot press and attic, with a convenient Stira\n\nBathroom - 2.1m (6'11\") x 3.35m (11'0\")\nThis room is floor to ceiling tiled and features a WC, WHB, rain shower, and bath. A fitted vanity unit providing additional storage\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.2m (10'6\") x 3.05m (10'0\")\nThis room has WELF, built in wardrobe and desk unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.06m (10'0\") x 3m (9'10\")\nThis room has WELF, built in wardrobes, drawers and shelving.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.14m (10'4\") x 3.37m (11'1\")\nThis room has WELF, Wardrobe with mirrored doors, built in desk unit and dressing table.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.25m (10'8\") x 3.95m (13'0\")\nThis room has WELF, built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.18m (3'10\") x 2.3m (7'7\")\nThis room is tiled floor to ceiling. WC and WHB, heated towel rail, electric shower and recess lighting\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
